e below full weight and are named as POL-GEN-02(3) requires. EV-CHAT-00202 (CHAT_LOG, weight 0.85, issue UNREAD_MESSAGE) does not carry the deciding fact — the dwell and cancellation are proved by the GPS trace and trip record — so the finding is unaffected by its discount. EV-DPROF-00202 (DRIVER_PROFILE, weight 0.9, issue SCHEMA_VERSION_MISMATCH) does carry the anti-farming determination; that finding survives the discount because its counters sit an order of magnitude below the POL-NS-07 thresholds and the schema change does not move them, and this artifact is what caps confidence at 0.90, above the 0.70 floor. No clause produces a referral on these facts."
